== Effects ==
* Replaces all new chests with {{e|Locked Chest|text=Golden Chests}}.
** {{e|Old Chest}}s and {{e|Mega Chest}}s are not replaced.
* Causes Golden Chests to either grant an item or multiple random pickups. This modifies the contents of Golden Chests to be able to give one or even multiple [[card]]s, [[Cards and Runes|runes]], and [[trinket]]s from a single chest alongside normal pickups when it doesn't reward an item.
** This includes one or more {{e|Lil' Battery}} and [[pill]] pickups allowing Golden Chests to drop these pickups.
* Gives Isaac one {{e|Key}} when picked up for the first time.

